SUMMARY:An Unknown Substance (BBC Storyville)
DESCRIPTION:From BBC Storyville\n\nVladimir Kara-Murza is a prominent Rus
 sian opposition politician and Pulitzer Prize-winning journalist who sur
 vived two near-fatal poisonings before being sentenced to 25 years in pr
 ison after speaking out against Russia’s invasion of Ukraine. This doc
 umentary short follows his wife\, Evgenia Kara-Murza\, during his impris
 onment as she mounts a global campaign to bring him home and ensure that
  his voice would not be silenced.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/tv/36695
 /season/30/episode/15
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/36695/season/30/episode/15
