SUMMARY:Bradley Walsh: Out of This World
DESCRIPTION:Bradley Walsh is heading Out of This World in a new series ex
 ploring some of the greatest mysteries on – and beyond – our planet.
  With his trademark humour\, curiosity and willingness to ask the questi
 ons the rest of us are thinking\, Bradley travels across Britain\, Europ
 e and America in search of answers to one enormous question: are we real
 ly alone? From UFOs and USOs to Atlantis\, Stonehenge and crop circles\,
  Bradley approaches the unexplained with an open mind\, a healthy dose o
 f scepticism and plenty of laughs.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/tv/3399
 39
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/339939
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
