SUMMARY:Children of Palestine
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Stefano Zito\n\nThe documentary reflects on the s
 ituation in Palestine from the perspective of a journalist\, an activist
 \, and a geopolitical analyst. It offers a deeply human perspective that
  seeks to raise public awareness. In a world where numbers are counted e
 very day\, the director attempts here to count the names. An important m
 essage of love for Palestine and for humanity\, reminding us that «we a
 re all children of Palestine»—meaning that each of us must consider o
 urselves part of the same human family.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/mo
 vie/1815215
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1815215
