SUMMARY:Dear Henry: Our Fight for Justice
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Tim Maynard\n\nHenry Nowak’s family speak for t
 he first time.  In this documentary\, they say they may have been “man
 ipulated in their darkest hours” by both Hampshire and Isle of Wight C
 onstabulary and the police watchdog in the months following his murder. 
  Bodycam footage shows the officers arresting Henry as he lay dying on t
 he ground.  The family has spoken to ITV News’ UK Editor Paul Brand ab
 out the way Henry was treated and their own dealings with the police in 
 the months after his death.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1820408
