 ure Is Sweet" is a independent coming-of-age snowboard documentary produ
 ced by the creative collective TDI (Technically Doing It). Featuring an 
 all-Black and Brown crew of riders travelling and filming across the glo
 be\, the film moves beyond high-level action sports progression to explo
 re deep themes of cultural identity\, community\, lifelong friendship\, 
