 urns her camera on her daughter\, Sofia\, as she shoots Marie Antoinette
 . Catching every detail of the behind-the-scenes and on-set action\, Ele
 anor captures the feat of Sofia’s directing a landmark film aged 34\, 
 and muses on what it means for a mother to watch her daughter at work.\n
