SUMMARY:Manhood (BBC Storyville)
DESCRIPTION:From BBC Storyville\n\nDallas businessman Bill Moore aims to 
 make penis enlargement as commonplace as Botox and bring the procedure i
 nto the mainstream\, positioning male cosmetic surgery as a growing part
  of the aesthetics industry.\n\nThe documentary follows several men\, in
 cluding an OnlyFans creator and a father of five\, as they put their bod
 ies on the line and undergo surgery in pursuit of physical transformatio
 n.\n\nThrough intimate access to both the practitioners selling the drea
 m and the men buying into it\, the film traces the insecurities\, trauma
  and societal pressures driving each of them\, while raising uncomfortab
 le questions about the ethics of an industry built on male self-doubt.\n
 \nFilmed over two years\, with dark humour and unexpected tenderness\, t
 his is a timely and revealing portrait of identity and self-image as cos
 metic surgery among men continues to rise.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org
 /tv/36695/season/30/episode/16
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/36695/season/30/episode/16
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
