SUMMARY:Answering The Call
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Martin Danneels\n\nOn Ireland’s rugged west coa
 st\, a rare call cuts through the summer night: a corncrake has returned
 . For those who have grown up with its rasping cry\, this is more than t
 he return of a bird. It is the sound of home\, of childhood summers and 
 a living connection to a landscape shaped by generations. But that famil
 iar voice is disappearing\, and with it\, a piece of who these communiti
 es are.  In Answering the Call\, communities of farmers\, locals and nat
 uralists unite in a race to save what few corncrake remain. As the commu
 nity rallies to answer the call\, one question becomes impossible to ign
 ore: if they fail to act now\, will they be the last generation to hear 
 this extraordinary sound?\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1819807
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1819807
