SUMMARY:When a Witness Recants (HBO Documentary Films)
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Dawn Porter\n\nFrom HBO Documentary Films\n\nIn 1
 983\, author Ta-Nehisi Coates learned that a 14-year-old boy was murdere
 d in his Baltimore middle school. Upon revisiting the case\, he uncovers
  the truth: Three innocent teenagers were wrongfully convicted and spent
  36 years in prison — creating a lasting impact on the accused\, the w
 itnesses\, and their community.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1596
 270
