SUMMARY:Observer
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Ian Cheney\n\nFilmmaker Ian Cheney embarks on an 
 experiment in which he brings a series of keen-eyed observers - scientis
 ts\, artists\, a hunter - to a range of locations around the world\, oft
 en without telling them where they are going\, and asks them simply to d
 escribe what they see. What unfolds is a deep exploration and celebratio
 n of the power of observation: what happens when you find new ways to se
 nse and perceive the world around you?\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/mov
 ie/1442281
