 through fragments of their daily lives\, where ordinary domestic gesture
 s intertwine with the quiet precision of athletic practice. Moving seaml
 essly from one to the next\, the film refuses hierarchy\, unfolding inst
 ead like the pages of a single book written by multiple hands.\n\nhttps:
