 ilm is a portrait of Taylor Shaffer’s coming-of-age as a photographer 
 and filmmaker\, following his creative trajectory as he shepherds Alex H
 onnold and Tommy Caldwell through a 2\,500-mile expedition to attempt a 
 single-day traverse of the Devil’s Thumb massif and finds his artistic
  voice amid risk\, friendship\, and a changing Alaskan landscape.\n\nhtt
 ps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1715868
