SUMMARY:The TransAtlantic Way
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Fergus Coyle\n\nAt dawn\, riders set off from Cor
 k City on a self-supported journey of up to 2\,400km\, bound for the fin
 ish line across Derry’s Peace Bridge\, battling fierce winds\, rugged 
 terrain\, and shifting light. Narrated by veteran long-distance cyclist 
 and event organiser Adrian O’Sullivan\, the film immerses viewers in I
 reland’s dark and mystical landscape\, capturing the endurance\, solit
 ude\, and raw beauty of the western coast.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org
 /movie/1793188
