DTSTAMP:20261109T145339Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261121
SUMMARY:Secret Rivers of the Nakanai
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Alexandre Lopez\n\nIn the village of Ruraï\, in 
 Papua New Guinea\, people tell of a water hidden deep within the Nakanai
  Mountains so pure that anyone who drinks it is said to gain extraordina
 ry powers. Immersed in the heart of a tropical rainforest\, a team of ca
 vers including the inimitable Cédric Lachat\, set out to uncover this m
 ysterious underground river system.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/
 1814885
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1814885
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
