DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261121
SUMMARY:Teeth to the Wind
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Ben Knight\n\nBefore Michael Gardner's death in N
 epal in 2024\, he and his climbing partner Sam Hennessey had started a f
 ilm project about their friendship. Remarkable alpinists\, but reluctant
  filmmakers\, Teeth to the Wind realizes Gardner and Hennessey's origina
 l vision: a joyful and unassuming glimpse at what they referred to as 
 “the spirit.”\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1747364
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1747364
