SUMMARY:Zuma Rock
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Luke Logan-Malik\n\nRotimi\, an amateur climber a
 nd writer from London with deep family roots in Nigeria sets out to achi
 eve the unthinkable: a first ascent of Zuma Rock\, a 300m monolith consi
 dered sacred by the communities who live in its shadow. To do it\, he en
 lists Olympic climbing champion Shauna Coxsey but neither of them has ev
 er tackled a wall of this scale.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/181
 6291
