SUMMARY:Wild Ice
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Mike Schwartz\n\nAs winter slowly reveals itself 
 across the Canadian Rockies\, artist and skater Elladj Baldé and photog
 rapher Paul Zizka chase the season’s first wild ice - a journey that b
 ecomes a reflection on freedom\, connection\, and the human desire to mo
 ve through life with intention.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1816
 232
