SUMMARY:Rodeo On Ice
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Lindsey Hagen\n\nWith skijoring poised to become 
 a potential addition to the 2030 Winter Olympics\, lifelong equestrian B
 ritta Nancarrow assembles a team to push her skijoring to the next level
 . The film follows Nancarrow as she trains with skier Mike King and snow
 boarder Sandra Hillen\, taking their on-snow skills to their very first 
 competition.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1813701
