SUMMARY:The Kelp Collector
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Jack Breedon\n\nAfter a career in science\, Sandy
  Webb has found a new passion in retirement: collecting and cataloguing 
 the diverse algae species that inhabit the waters near her Melbourne hom
 e. With the precision of a scientist and the eye of an artist\, she tran
 sforms her discoveries into exquisite pressed-seaweed specimens\, The ke
 lp collector reveals how Sandy's dedication to documenting local marine 
 life connects her to the coastal environment she calls home.\n\nhttps://
 www.themoviedb.org/movie/1803682
