SUMMARY:The Art of Hold Shaping
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Dean Tucker\n\nAn intimate documentary exploring 
 the world of Dan Yagmin as the creative force behind Decoy Holds. Moving
  between wild landscapes\, workshop processes and climbing walls\, the f
 ilm is a portrait of an artist shaping not just holds\, but the way we e
 xperience climbing itself.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1807143
