SUMMARY:The Long Way Home
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Amon Barker\n\nKelly Halpin has long dreamed of c
 ompleting a full traverse of the beautiful and seldom travelled Gros Ven
 tre mountain range right in her backyard in Wyoming. The route is 50 mil
 es off-trail over technical terrain and hits every major summit in the r
 ange. After years of scouting and two failed attempts the film shows the
  power of perseverance and dreaming big while staying close to home.\n\n
 https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1812004
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1812004
