DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261121
SUMMARY:Tiba
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Mario Ruiz\n\nThis isn't quite a climbing story. 
 It's a pause on the mountain\, seen through the eyes of Tiba\, a young C
 olombian climber whose voice already seems to know a path his feet have 
 only begun to walk. The film follows the quiet bond between the boy and 
 the walls he climbs\, a place where he finds calm\, discipline\, and a f
 reedom rare for someone his age. Up there\, the height turns out to be t
 he least of it.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1815404
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1815404
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
