DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261120
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261121
SUMMARY:Senu
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Marianne Skeffington\n\nSenu is the first Sri Lan
 kan female surfer to compete for her country. Most local girls in Sri La
 nka are never taught to swim\, let alone surf. Senu is beginning to teac
 h local girls to surf\, and we see the first signs of change: more girls
  playing with the waves\, learning and dreaming.\n\nhttps://www.themovie
 db.org/movie/1814904
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1814904
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
