SUMMARY:Into the Light
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Mikey Corker\n\nFollow two young South African su
 rfers whose lives could not be more precarious and whose dreams\, agains
 t all odds\, carry them across an ocean they were never meant to touch. 
 Born from struggle\, but fuelled by possibility\, the story illuminates 
 the belief that sport and education can bridge divides and shows how two
  young athletes challenge the weight of history.\n\nhttps://www.themovie
 db.org/movie/1810746
