SUMMARY:Elsewhere: Randi Skaug
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Toby Roney\n\nRandi Skaug was the first Norwegian
  woman to climb Mount Everest and went on to complete the Seven Summits.
  She has led expeditions around the world\, written books and inspired t
 housands of people to embrace the outdoors. Now going through cancer tre
 atment and unable to return to her remote island house\, Randi welcomes 
 us into her eclectic home in Oslo. As her world grows smaller\, her pers
 pective grows clearer. For Randi\, a lifetime of extraordinary achieveme
 nt has led to one simple conclusion: be kind.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.
 org/movie/1808194
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1808194
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
