SUMMARY:Against the Clock
DESCRIPTION:Directed by John Baikie\n\nA short documentary exploring the 
 life and passion of cyclist Alasdair Washington. Blending race footage w
 ith moments of personal reflection\, the film offers an honest portrait 
 of his lasting connection to the sport. It looks at the discipline\, det
 ermination and enjoyment that continue to fuel his competitive spirit. R
 ather than focusing on results alone\, the story captures the essence of
  what it means to keep showing up and pushing forward. What keeps the wh
 eels turning when time refuses to slow down? Both intimate and authentic
 \, the film celebrates a lifelong passion for cycling and community.\n\n
 https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1797220
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1797220
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
