SUMMARY:Wild Camps
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Stewart Baxter\n\n​​This short film was co-cr
 eated with young people\, all of whom live in Hull\, a city in Northern 
 England which is the least wooded in the whole of the UK. Through poetry
  and participatory action research\, the youth delve into the impact of 
 nature immersion on a five-day Wild Camp with Rewilding Youth has on the
 m.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1816198
