SUMMARY:3 Peaks Cyclocross
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Keenan DesPlanques\n\nFirst run in 1961 by the Br
 adford Cycling Club\, the classic race crosses Pen-y-Ghent\, Whernside a
 nd Ingleborough\, three fells above the River Ribble in the Yorkshire Da
 les. The course is now 61km in length\, with 33km on unsurfaced ground\,
  28km on road\, and six to eight km that the organisers deem unrideable.
  Join Lachlan Morton for a cyclocross race like no other.\n\nhttps://www
 .themoviedb.org/movie/1805455
