SUMMARY:Hotpipe Hillbillies
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Stephanie Hubbard\n\nA documentary about communit
 y\, resilience\, and finding joy in the most unlikely of places. Against
  the backdrop of Shoreham’s industrial shoreline\, a diverse crew of s
 urfers gather at an industrial outflow pipe to ride waves that are often
  messy\, fickle\, and short-lived. This ain’t Cornwall. It sure ain’
 t California. But for this crew\, it’s home\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.
 org/movie/1810500
