DESCRIPTION:Directed by Scott Secco\n\nBas Van Steenbergen heads up Mt. S
 eymour on Vancouver's North Shore — the birthplace of freeride —ridi
 ng with a rhythm all his own.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/180718
 8
