SUMMARY:Roots
DESCRIPTION:Directed by George Madison\n\nMore than 200 days of the year\
 , you can find local Vermonter and ski patroller Ethan Parrish skiing so
 me of the most extreme terrain in the Vermont backcountry. Ethan is awar
 e of the impact of outsiders on local life\, from the strain on communit
 y to reckless practices in the backcountry. While clearing the land surr
 ounding his great-uncle’s farmhouse\, he dreams of his own future\, li
 ving off the land and skiing Vermont’s Green Mountains. Roots explores
  his deep connection to the mountains\, the people in his life\, and his
  home.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1813729
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1813729
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
