SUMMARY:I Follow Rivers
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Barbora Hollan\n\nMariann Sæther is one of the b
 est whitewater kayakers in the world. Since she was a teenager\, she has
  challenged expectations within sport and society. When she becomes a mo
 ther\, she is determined she can both be an extreme sports athlete and h
 ave a family. But is life on the river really worth the risk?\n\nhttps:/
 /www.themoviedb.org/movie/1647235
