SUMMARY:Phantom 814
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Jake Hanrahan\n\nHeavy Weekend 03: Unique access 
 to the most mysterious organisation in France. Jake Hanrahan travels wit
 h the bizarre syndicate known as "814SSR". They shoot guns\, host fight 
 clubs\, and make money in the underground. Yet still\, they insist they'
 re not a gang and are simply doing hardcore trolling. The truth? Decide 
 for yourself...\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1749739
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1749739
