SUMMARY:Small People\, Big Adventures - Currents of Curiosity
DESCRIPTION:Renowned explorer Leo Houlding embarks on a remarkable family
  expedition to the Calvados Island chain - one of the most remote inhabi
 ted regions on Earth\, located 300km off the coast of Papua New Guinea. 
 Here\, money is meaningless and life is sustained through subsistence li
 ving\, deep connection to nature and community exchange.\n\nhttps://www.
 themoviedb.org/movie/1808111
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1808111
