DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261121
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261122
SUMMARY:You Told Us To Talk About the Weather
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Harry Tomlin\n\nIn the past six hours\, 94% of Br
 its have spoken about the weather. In the past five years\, 7000 Brits h
 ave been arrested for speaking out about the climate crisis. This short 
 film\, starring Michael Sheen\, has been developed with young farmers an
 d colleges in rural Norfolk. It questions why it’s so hard for us to h
 ave meaningful conversations about climate change. Told through the eyes
  of a child grappling with climate anxiety\, the film explores the cost 
 of British small talk and encourages audiences to elevate their daily ha
 bits into tools for meaningful change.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/mov
 ie/1647346
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1647346
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
