DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261121
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261122
SUMMARY:The Impossible Journey
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Mike Douglas\n\nIn 2013 Danish adventurer\, Thor 
 Pedersen\, left his loved ones behind and set off in an attempt to becom
 e the first person to visit every country in the world without flying. H
 e wanted adventure\, a title\, and to show that the world is a much bett
 er place than is portrayed in the news. He got an experience that tested
  every layer of him as a human being.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movi
 e/1801245
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1801245
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
