DTSTAMP:20261109T145339Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261121
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261122
SUMMARY:Skyclimber: Scaling the Eiffel Tower
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Nick Hardie\n\nUrban free climber Adam Lockwood a
 ttempts to scale the Eiffel Tower in a documentary that is equal parts h
 igh-altitude adventure and intimate personal portrait. A film that build
 s its tension with the precision of a heist movie\, mapping every step o
 f an audacious ascent.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1686182
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1686182
