DTSTAMP:20261109T145339Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261121
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261122
SUMMARY:Excalibur\, A Pursuit in Process
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Ben Neilson\n\nBrooke Raboutou takes on Excalibur
  (5.15c / 9b+) in Arco\, Italy. This film documents the process\, hardsh
 ips\, and relentless perseverance—both mental and physical—behind he
 r pursuit of one of the hardest routes in the world. At just 18 moves\, 
 Excalibur is a brutally condensed testpiece of pure power endurance on r
 azor-sharp holds. Brooke’s ascent not only marks a leap in her career 
 – becoming the first woman to climb 5.15c / 9b+ – but also represent
 s a meaningful step in closing the long-standing gap between men and wom
 en at the absolute cutting edge of sport climbing.\n\nhttps://www.themov
 iedb.org/movie/1679802
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1679802
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
