DTSTAMP:20261109T145339Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261121
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261122
SUMMARY:The Dawn Wall By Your Side
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Soline Kentzel\n\nThe Dawn Wall is the hardest bi
 g wall in the world. After his failure in 2021\, Seb Berthe sets sail ag
 ain for a second attempt. Strongly supported by Soline Kentzel\, Seb wil
 l have to give his all to\, maybe\, achieve his lifetime dream. But he i
 s not the only one with a dream\, and Soline also embarks on an extremel
 y ambitious ascent. More than a story of performance\, this documentary 
 intimately and deeply questions\, through Soline’s perspective\, the m
 eaning of the climbing partnership.\n\nhttps://www.themoviedb.org/movie/
 1808139
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1808139
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
